<![CDATA[<p class="xmsonormal" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><b style="color: rgb(0, 0, 102); font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font style="">Solution Suggested Reminder</font></b></p><p class="xmsonormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#000066" face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><b><br></b></span></font></p><p class="xmsonormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">The status of your case was changed to Solution Suggested five days ago. Please confirm with your Application Support Consultant&nbsp;that the case may be closed by responding to this email.</span></font></p><p class="xmsonormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" style=""><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><br></span></font></p><p class="xmsonormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><b>Case Information:</b></span></font></p><p class="xmsonormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif"><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><b><br></b></span></font></p><p class="xmsonormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" style="" size="2"><b style=""><font color="#000066" style="">Subject:</font></b>&nbsp;{!Case.Subject}</font></p><p class="xmsonormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="2"><br></font></p><p class="xmsonormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="2"><font color="#000066"><b>Description:</b></font>&nbsp;{!Case.Description}</font></p><p class="xmsonormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial;"><font face="Arial,Sans-Serif" size="2"><